# Anchor to repo root only — core/state/ (source tree) must NOT be ignored.
/state/
# Same anchoring, same reason (#1918): ADR-058's per-stage scratch lives under
# the job's state dir, but an ad-hoc caller that hands plugin_hook_call a
# RELATIVE state file gets `dirname` == "." and writes ./scratch/<stage>/ into
# whatever the CWD is. The engine refuses that (lifecycle.sh guards on an
# absolute path) and a test that ablates the guard reproduces it — which is
# exactly how five ephemeral event-bus files reached a commit here. The floor is
# `git add` never sweeping one up. core/pipeline/stage-scratch.sh is a FILE, not
# a directory, so it is unaffected.
/scratch/
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# doc-generate short-circuit hash sidecars — local regen cache, not committed (#1492)
*.md.hash
